{"step_index":129,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:05:48Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"# StreamWave Serverless Media Platform\\n\\nAcademic prototype of a serverless media streaming application built for **StreamWave Entertainment** (a fictional Zimbabwean entertainment company). Constructed with **Python 3.12** and **FastAPI**, engineered specifically for deployment on **Vercel Functions** with **Vercel Blob Storage** and **5-Second MP4 Video Preview** support.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Key Features & Architectural Highlights\\n\\n- **Vercel Serverless Native**: Designed without continuous background processes, SQLite, or runtime filesystem writes to respect Vercel's read-only/ephemeral execution model.\\n- **Movie Video Preview**: All movie titles (*Cook Off*, *Neria*, *Gonarezhou*, *Shaina*) present a 5-second StreamWave MP4 video preview (`/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`) in a dedicated modal player upon clicking **\\\"Watch Preview\\\"**.\\n- **Music Audio Demonstration**: Music items continue utilizing the fixed HTML5 audio player (`/media/demo.wav` or Vercel Blob CDN) upon clicking **\\\"Play Sample\\\"**.\\n- **Zero Media Proxying**: Media audio and video bytes are fetched directly by the browser from static assets or Vercel Blob CDN. Bytes are never proxied through FastAPI serverless endpoints.\\n- **FastAPI & Pydantic Validation**: Strict type annotations, security middleware headers, and Pydantic schema validation for all requests and responses.\\n- **Structured Logged Playback Events**: `POST /api/play-events` validates media IDs, attaches UTC server timestamps, and emits structured JSON event logs directly to stdout.\\n- **StreamWave Responsive UI**: Dark graphite styling (`#121214`), restrained red accent (`#e50914`), clean rectangular media cards, accessible HTML5 video and audio modal players, and `<dialog>` details modal.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎥 Movie Video Preview Configuration\\n\\n- **Asset Path**: `public/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`\\n- **Relative URL**: `/media/streamwave-preview.mp4`\\n- **Video Specifications**: HTML5 `<video>` player with `controls`, `playsinline`, `preload=\\\"metadata\\\"`, black player backg\n<truncated 3286 bytes>","Description":"\"Update README.md with 5-second MP4 video preview configuration and architecture details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\README.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating README.md with video preview documentation\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating README.md with video preview documentation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
