he featured hero banner (*Cook Off*).\\n   - Displays the selected movie title above the video player.\\n   - HTML5 `<video>` element with `controls`, `playsinline`, `preload=\\\"metadata\\\"`, 16:9 aspect ratio, and black background (`#000000`).\\n   - Plays automatically upon direct user click.\\n   - Shows **🔄 Replay Preview** and **Close** buttons when the 5-second video finishes (`ended` event).\\n\\n4. **Modal Behavior & Accessibilit\n<truncated 3551 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough.md with 5-second MP4 video preview implementation details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
