{"step_index":177,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:55:15Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated walkthrough.md documenting Netflix-style landing hero and Sign In modal integration for StreamWave Entertainment.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: StreamWave Netflix-Style Landing Page & Auth Modal Integration\\n\\nThe **StreamWave Entertainment** platform has been enhanced with a Netflix-inspired landing page hero section, brand logo integration, custom favicons, and an interactive Sign In modal.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🍿 Key Features Added\\n\\n1. **Netflix-Style Landing Hero Section**:\\n   - Headline: *\\\"Unlimited Zimbabwean movies, music, and more\\\"*.\\n   - Subtitle: *\\\"Stream anywhere. Serverless performance. Cancel anytime.\\\"*.\\n   - Email Input & **`Get Started ›`** red action button.\\n   - Smoothly scrolls down to the media catalogue upon submitting an email or clicking *Get Started*.\\n\\n2. **Sign In Modal (`<dialog id=\\\"auth-dialog\\\">`)**:\\n   - Top navigation **Sign In** button opens an accessible dark graphite modal.\\n   - Email / phone and password input fields.\\n   - Demo mode notification enabling seamless exploratory authentication.\\n\\n3. **Official StreamWave Logo & Favicon**:\\n   - Header navigation logo (`/images/streamwave-logo.png`).\\n   - Browser tab favicon icon ([`public/images/favicon.png`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/images/favicon.png) & [`public/favicon.ico`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/favicon.ico)).\\n\\n4. **Streamlined Action Labels & Icons**:\\n   - Movie Card Action: **`▶ Watch`**.\\n   - Music Card Action: **`▶ Play`**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📁 Files Modified\\n\\n| File Path | Description |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| [`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html) | Added Netflix-style landing hero section, email form, Sign In modal, and favicon link tags. |\\n| [`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css) | Added dark radial hero wallpaper styling, email form rules, larger logo rules, and Auth modal layout. |\\n| [`public/js/app.js`](file:///C:\n<truncated 1103 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough.md with Netflix-style landing hero and Auth modal details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
